          "author": "Momma Bear Audio",
          "description": "Get ready for a wild game of Bingo – Halloween Edition! This interactive audio brings a fun twist to the classic game, featuring 10 rounds of Halloween-themed Bingo that the whole family can enjoy. With eight different printable Bingo boards, up to eight players can join in on the fun, or kids can play multiple times with different boards!Here’s how it works:Listen as Ms. Rylee calls out a picture.Mark it on your board using small objects like coins, buttons or pencil.Get five in a row: across, down, or diagonally, to win!Keep playing until everyone gets a Bingo or restart for another round.With 24 different pictures in each game, kids will stay engaged while practicing listening skills, focus, and a little bit of strategy. Whether playing solo, with family, or at a playdate, this game is an exciting way to bring learning and laughter together.Perfect for ages 3-10, Bingo – Halloween Edition is a great screen-free activity that keeps kids entertained while boosting observation and matching skills. Grab your game board, press play, and let’s get those Bingos!Run Time: 48 min\n\nLooking for other free audio sources, ideas and inspo? Maybe you want to submit a request for some sort of specific audio for your kids? Join my FB Group! I am always taking suggestions and working to get the audio your kids want.\nToyo Momma Bear source: a2e1b23887da6e6c655102f0cb3d13aa2d37153050659e05b7aa0d88295c35ee",
